flowchart TD
 Job[Queued ingestion] --> Lease[Claim leased job]
 Lease --> Process[Parse and embed]
 Process --> Success[Atomic active-generation switch]
 Process --> Failure[Classified failure]
 Failure --> Retain[Keep previous active index]
 Retain --> Retry[Owner retries after fixing cause]
 Retry --> Job
 Lease --> Crash[Worker crash or lost lease]
 Crash --> Attempts{Attempts remain}
 Attempts -->|yes| Job
 Attempts -->|no| Failed[Persist failed state]
 Source[Raw file and DB mismatch] --> Check[Read-only consistency report]
